*.bak
*.backup
*.old
*.orig
*.tmp
*.temp
*~
~$*
*_before_*.yaml
*_before_*.yml
*_before_*.json
*_before_*.py
*_backup_*.yaml
*_backup_*.yml
*_backup_*.json
*_backup_*.py

